pan lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">석사과정 성적증명서&nbsp;</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">1</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">부</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">7.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">참고사항</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"margin-left: 116.4pt; padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all; text-indent: -116.4pt;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"letter-spacing: -0.3pt; font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">가</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">학점인정 방법</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 12pt;\">:&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">해당 학과</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: -0.6pt; font-size: 12pt;\">소속이수인정학과 포함</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spac