 학기</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-size: 12pt;\"></span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">다</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">.&nbsp;</span><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">학점인정이 되는 경우라도 수업연한단축은 불가함</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: break-all;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"font-family: 굴림; letter-spacing: 0pt; font-size: 12pt;\">2026. 3.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; font-size: 12pt; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">&nbsp;<o:p></o:p></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"padding-top: 0px; line-height: 1.5rem; color: rgb(33, 33, 33); font-family: &quot;Noto Sans KR&quot;, &quot;Nanum Gothic&quot;, Helvetica, sans-serif; word-break: keep-all; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: 굴림; font-size: 12pt;\">국립금오공과대학교 대학원장</span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t